{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113525","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113525/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113525/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113525/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113525","id":3691665056,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc626OSt","number":113525,"title":"Fix crash in `command_queue_mt` due to destruction of wrong object","user":{"login":"brycehutchings","id":5100250,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMDAyNTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5100250?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings","html_url":"https://github.com/brycehutchings","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-12-03T19:48:37Z","updated_at":"2026-01-08T22:58:30Z","closed_at":"2025-12-05T12:00:35Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113525","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113525","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113525.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113525.patch","merged_at":"2025-12-05T12:00:35Z"},"body":"This is a possible way to fix the issue in #113445.\r\n\r\nI narrowed the problem down to the usage of this method being queued on the command_queue:\r\n\r\n```c++\r\nvoid environment_set_glow(RID p_env, bool p_enable, Vector<float> p_levels, float p_intensity, float p_strength, float p_mix, float p_bloom_threshold, RS::EnvironmentGlowBlendMode p_blend_mode, float p_hdr_bleed_threshold, float p_hdr_bleed_scale, float p_hdr_luminance_cap, float p_glow_map_strength, RID p_glow_map)\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhat I believe was happening was the `Command` was getting memcpy'd into a temporary buffer but the invocation of the callback uses std::move which can cause these parameters to become mutated:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\n_FORCE_INLINE_ R call_impl(IndexSequence<I...>) {\r\n\t// Move out of the Tuple, this will be destroyed as soon as the call is complete.\r\n\treturn (instance->*method)(std::move(get<I>())...);\r\n                               ^^^^^^^^^\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nAnd so the Vector<float> in the copied memory was getting mutated by this std::move, but the original copy in `command_mem` was not updated and so when it was destroyed it also tried to free the memory pointed to by the Vector not knowing it had already been freed.\r\n\r\nTo handle this, we need to follow the rules for relocating objects and destroy the new copy of the Command object and not the original one.\r\n\r\nI tested this both with the MRP and with TPS demo. I also ran the unit tests with `--test -ts=\"[CommandQueue]\"`\r\n\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113445","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113525/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113525/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}